{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31593","headline":"献王中丞 · 李羣玉","name":"献王中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登仙望绝李膺舟，从此青蝇点遂稠。\n半夜劒吹牛斗动，二年门掩雀罗愁。\n张仪会展平生舌，韩信那慙跨下羞。\n他日图勳画麟阁，定呈肝胆始应休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}